Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(terminal):=20=E6=89=93=E5=BC=80=E7=BB=88?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=AB=AF=E4=B8=8D=E5=86=8D=E5=8E=8B=E5=8D=A0=E4=BD=8D=E9=A1=B5?=
